			<dict>
				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>The route left after Probe-TabJs. Run JavaScript on Web Page refuses a Tab entity, so a live page is reachable only through the share sheet; this needs no page at all. js-data-url already runs a script this way and returns its value, so the only open question is whether a library can be fetched and evaluated first, inside the coercion's capture moment. Four lines come back, so one tap separates failures that otherwise look alike.</string>
